# Which subsystem directory each driver of the kernel lives in, and where it goes in Apple's XNU tree.
#
#   <subsystem>  <path in the XNU tree>
#
# The repository file is drivers/<subsystem>/<file name>. xnu/apply.sh copies each of them to its path in the tree,
# xnu/export.sh copies them back, tools/drivers-check.py (and CI) checks that this list and the directories agree.
# A new hakios.* file in bsd/dev/ or iokit/Kernel/ has to be listed here: export.sh refuses to guess.
#
